~ start
{{assignment_context.official_name}}: {{assignment_context.opening_line}}
- Ask about the written record
	{{assignment_context.official_name}}: {{assignment_context.record_response}}
	=> questions
- Ask what was witnessed
	{{assignment_context.official_name}}: {{assignment_context.witness_response}}
	=> questions
- Ask what result the office seeks
	{{assignment_context.official_name}}: {{assignment_context.requested_result}}
	=> questions
- End the interview => END

